    },
    {
      "what": "demo-only files in demo/assets/",
      "reason": "`demo-completion.js`: the keys of the specimen „Feld mit Vorschlägen“; sebaro ships no completion script, the app or its editor owns the keys (spec/02 §4.26); `demo.css`: specimen chrome and phone stand-ins; `pages.css`: reference page layout"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Tauri loads the web fonts (`fonts/fonts.css` + `fonts/web/*.woff2`) on every platform (D66, D77), unhinted where the system ships variable WOFF2. macOS (WKWebView) ignores hinting; Windows (WebView2) and Linux (WebKitGTK): rendering without hinting unverified (D43, D77). Static desktop TTFs are for native code (the `macos` and `ios` targets) and renderers that cannot read WOFF2.",
    "`brand/inline/` comes from systems/sebaro/brand/inline/, which no sebaroDesign gate checks for freshness (it is written by a script of the system, not by tools/brand_assets.py).",
    "The Tauri icon set (.icns, .ico, PNG sizes) is not in sebaroDesign: run `tauri icon` on `tauri/icon-1024.png` in the target repo (README, section Tauri).",
    "Exported for novalis: tokens.json, icons.json, SebaroTheme.kt, SebaroTokens.swift and the Android in-app tiles keep only novalis and the umbrella studio; no file names another product (fit for a public repository). To show other products' tiles, export with --product studio."
  ]
}
